msgid ""
"With no other choice, you put the penthouse of Arkham’s Northside district behind you. No matter how far you go, you worry there won’t be enough distance between you and the monsters that ravaged the party and turned it into a bloodbath. It doesn’t take long for word of those events to spread throughout Arkham, and for more disappearances to take place as the creatures continue to hunt and feed in the dead of night. Eventually you decide to leave the city, relocating to Boston and thinking that at long last you can try and forget about the calamity on the Miskatonic.\n"
"But no matter how far you go, no matter how close you are to forgetting everything, in a matter of months you hear reports similar to those that led up to the chaos that plagued Arkham. The tainted blood of Zburamoarte and the machinations of the Cult of the Sanguine Order are spreading across New England. How long will it be before you have nowhere else to run?"
msgstr ""
"你别无选择，只得放弃阿卡姆北区的顶层公寓。那头蹂躏宴会、将宴会变成一场血腥屠杀的怪物。无论你走多远，你都担心离它还不够远。没过多久，相关事件的风言风语就传遍了阿卡姆，怪物依然在深夜狩猎捕食，更多的失踪案层出不穷。最终你决定离开这座城，搬到波士顿，想着终于可以忘记米斯卡塔尼克河畔的灾变。\n"
"但无论你走多远，无论你多么想忘记一切，只是过了几个月，你就听到了和阿卡姆那时的混乱类似的报道。孜卜拉牟特的污血、血色教派的阴谋正在整个新英格兰蔓延。再过多久，你就会无处可逃？"

msgid "Check Campaign Log. If both <i>the investigators stopped the children of blood</i> and <i>the investigators defeated Zburamoarte</i>:"
msgstr "检查剧本日志。如果同时记录了<i>调查员阻止了鲜血之子</i>和<i>调查员击败了孜卜拉牟特</i>："

msgid "The events of the penthouse in Northside finally behind you, it seems that at long last the city of Arkham can breathe a sigh of relief. As the days begin to pass, the people who were subjected to the tainted blood of Zburamoarte at the hands of the cult begin to recover. They are weak, disoriented, and lacking any memory of their transformations. Against all odds, it seems that the diabolical machinations of Howard Wilkes and the Cult of the Sanguine Order are finally put to rest."
msgstr "北区顶层公寓的事情已经被你放下，看来阿卡姆终于可以松一口气了。日子一天天过去，被教派魔爪中孜卜拉牟特的污血支配的人们开始康复。他们虚弱、迷茫，丢失了自己变形的记忆。纵使万般不易，霍华德·威尔克斯和血色教派的邪恶密谋看来已经化解。"

msgid ""
"The events of the penthouse in Northside finally behind you, it seems that at long last the city of Arkham can breathe a sigh of relief. As the days begin to pass, however, rumors and whispers of monsters in the night seem to return. In a matter of weeks, it seems Arkham is right back to where it started on that fateful night in the Waterfront District. More disappearances are reported throughout the city, and you fear the creatures have returned to hunt and feed in the dead of night. Eventually you decide to leave Arkham, relocating to Boston and thinking that at long last you can try and forget about the calamity on the Miskatonic.\n"
"But no matter how far you go, no matter how close you are to forgetting everything, in a matter of months you hear reports similar to those that led up to the chaos that plagued Arkham. The tainted blood of Zburamoarte, and the machinations of the Cult of the Sanguine Order, have returned, and are spreading across New England. How long will it be before you have nowhere else to run?"
msgstr ""
"北区顶层公寓的事情已经被你放下，看来阿卡姆终于可以松一口气了。日子一天天过去，然而关于那晚怪物的流言细语再次骚动。过了几周，阿卡姆似乎回到了滨水区当初的那一夜，仿佛宿命。城里传说有更多的失踪案，你担心怪物已经回来，在深夜狩猎捕食。最终你决定离开阿卡姆，搬到波士顿，想着终于可以忘记米斯卡塔尼克河畔的灾变。\n"
"但无论你走多远，无论你多么想忘记一切，只是过了几个月，你就听到了和阿卡姆那时的混乱类似的报道。孜卜拉牟特的污血、血色教派的阴谋已经归来，正在整个新英格兰蔓延。再过多久，你就会无处可逃？"

msgid "Weeks later, you find yourself walking down the sidewalk of Water Street once again. That bloody and desperate night seems like a distant memory fading into shadows as the sun rises from the Eastern horizon. As you continue on your way, you catch a glimpse of a familiar face—a middle-aged woman, with long dark hair pulled back into a tight bun, dressed in the blue coveralls of a factory worker. She looks up as she crosses the street, and your eyes meet for a brief moment. She doesn’t recognize you, but you know immediately that it’s Julia. She offers a polite smile before she continues on, eventually disappearing into the growing crowds."
msgstr "几周后，你走在水岸街的步道上。太阳从东方又一次升起，那血腥而绝望的一夜已经仿佛遥远的记忆，消散在阴影中。你继续前行，却瞥见一张熟悉的面孔——一个长发紧紧束成髻的中年女子，穿着工厂工人的蓝色工作服。她过街的时候抬了头，你们的眼神交汇了一刻。她没有认出你，但你立刻就知道那就是朱利亚。她礼貌地微笑一下，继续往前，最终在熙攘的人群中渐渐消失。"
